    "Voice input starts only when you tap Talk and is transcribed on-device. Tap again to cancel, even while permissions are being requested.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice input starts only when you tap Talk and is transcribed on-device. Tap again to cancel, even while permissions are being requested."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「話す」を押したときだけ音声入力を開始し、端末内で文字にします。権限の確認中も、もう一度押すとキャンセルできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ZK verifies private spending rules. Payment recipients and amounts are public. The current settlement design trusts the signature of the server that verifies the proof.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ZK verifies private spending rules. Payment recipients and amounts are public. The current settlement design trusts the signature of the server that verifies the proof."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ZKは非公開の支出ルールへの適合を証明します。支払先と金額は公開されます。現在の決済は、証明を検証するサーバーの署名を信頼する設計です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
