    "Set the price above your limit, or turn off translation. Mate refuses to generate a proof at preflight. That local refusal is separate from the cryptographic modified-proof check above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the price above your limit, or turn off translation. Mate refuses to generate a proof at preflight. That local refusal is separate from the cryptographic modified-proof check above."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "料金を上限より高くするか、翻訳の許可を外してください。Mateは事前チェックで証明の生成を拒否します。この拒否は、上の暗号学的な改ざん証明の検査とは別です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settlement currently relies on the server verifier's signed attestation; the vault does not verify ProveKit proofs directly. This exercise demonstrates the native circuit, not server or blockchain enforcement.": {
      "localizations": {
