            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みの操作を復元しています。登録や支払いを繰り返すことはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A previous operation needs confirmation. Recover it before changing connections or creating another order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A previous operation needs confirmation. Recover it before changing connections or creating another order."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前の操作が未確定です。接続の変更や新しい注文の前に、その結果を確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify your HTTPS service, test network and public Privy app IDs. Your existing connection stays in place until the new one passes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verify your HTTPS service, test network and public Privy app IDs. Your existing connection stays in place until the new one passes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPSサービス、テストネットワーク、Privyの公開アプリIDを確認します。検証成功まで現在の接続を保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with your existing Privy account. This does not create a mandate or send funds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in with your existing Privy account. This does not create a mandate or send funds."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "既存のPrivyアカウントでログインします。この操作で委任の作成や送金は行いません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your owner wallet approves permissions. Mate uses a separate execution key. Existing wallets are restored first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your owner wallet approves permissions. Mate uses a separate execution key. Existing wallets are restored first."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有者のウォレットで権限を承認し、Mateは別の実行キーを使います。既存のウォレットを先に復元します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh the current balance before continuing. A saved setup step is not evidence of available funds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh the current balance before continuing. A saved setup step is not evidence of available funds."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在の残高を確認してください。保存された準備の進捗だけでは、資金があるとは判断しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The execution account has no test USDC. In Wallet, review the amount, approve it, then deposit. Each transaction needs its own approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
