    "Allows tracking and small reactions while the camera is explicitly active. Turning this off or enabling Reduce Motion stops stand movement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allows tracking and small reactions while the camera is explicitly active. Turning this off or enabling Reduce Motion stops stand movement."
          }
