            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ビールを1本買って。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send the request to open Mate's store. You'll tap your My Number card and approve 0.10 test USDC before payment. No physical delivery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send the request to open Mate's store. You'll tap your My Number card and approve 0.10 test USDC before payment. No physical delivery."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "送信するとMateの店舗を開きます。マイナンバーカードをタッチし、0.10テストUSDCの支払いを承認して進みます。商品の配送はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result is not confirmed yet. Check the existing request before paying again.": {
      "localizations": {
