          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native total includes key loading, witness creation, proving, verification and serialization. Resource hashing and the modified-order check are separate. File caches are not controlled; repeat runs before comparing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native total includes key loading, witness creation, proving, verification and serialization. Resource hashing and the modified-order check are separate. File caches are not controlled; repeat runs before comparing."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ネイティブ処理全体にはキー読込・Witness作成・証明生成・検証・シリアライズを含みます。リソースのハッシュ確認と改変注文の検査は別です。ファイルキャッシュは制御していないため、複数回計測して比較してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WHIR is experimental here. Purchases still use the verified Groth16 path. Wrapped WHIR is unavailable because the upstream recursive verifier is not compatible with this proof format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHIR is experimental here. Purchases still use the verified Groth16 path. Wrapped WHIR is unavailable because the upstream recursive verifier is not compatible with this proof format."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHIRは実験用です。購入には検証済みのGroth16経路を使用します。上流の再帰検証器がこの証明形式に対応していないため、ラップしたWHIRは利用できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proof sizes use the native ProveKit file format, not EVM calldata. This benchmark does not establish zero-knowledge privacy, production security or on-chain compatibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proof sizes use the native ProveKit file format, not EVM calldata. This benchmark does not establish zero-knowledge privacy, production security or on-chain compatibility."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "証明サイズはEVM calldataではなくProveKitのネイティブ形式です。この計測はゼロ知識性・本番環境の安全性・オンチェーン互換性を保証しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
